msgid ""
"Usage: linto quarto render [-h|--help] [--] [file.qmd ...]\n"
"\n"
"Rebuild the bibliographies (linto bib bibyml2bib), then render each Quarto\n"
"document with `quarto render`. Without arguments, every *.qmd in the current\n"
"directory is rendered; .qmd files given as arguments are rendered instead.\n"
"\n"
"Run it from the project root, where the .qmd files are.\n"
"\n"
"Options:\n"
"  -h, --help  Show this help and exit."
msgstr ""
"Usage: linto quarto render [-h|--help] [--] [fichier.qmd ...]\n"
"\n"
"Régénère les bibliographies (linto bib bibyml2bib), puis rend chaque document\n"
"Quarto avec `quarto render`. Sans argument, tous les *.qmd du dossier courant\n"
"sont rendus ; les fichiers .qmd passés en argument sont rendus à la place.\n"
"\n"
"Doit être lancé depuis la racine du projet, où se trouvent les fichiers .qmd.\n"
"\n"
"Options :\n"
"  -h, --help  Affiche cette aide et quitte."

msgid ""
"Usage: linto quarto guillemets2quotes [-h|--help] [--] FILE\n"
"\n"
"Replace French guillemets with straight double quotes in FILE.\n"
