msgid ""
"Usage: linto quarto setup [-h|--help]\n"
"\n"
"Find the nearest ancestor containing _extensions/. If it contains\n"
"_extensions/chris2fr, update chris2fr/quarto there; otherwise add it there.\n"
"If no ancestor contains _extensions/, add chris2fr/quarto from the current\n"
"directory.\n"
"\n"
"Options:\n"
"  -h, --help  Show this help and exit."
msgstr ""
"Usage: linto quarto setup [-h|--help]\n"
"\n"
"Cherche l'ancêtre le plus proche qui contient _extensions/. S'il contient\n"
"_extensions/chris2fr, met à jour chris2fr/quarto à cet endroit ; sinon l'y\n"
"ajoute. Si aucun ancêtre ne contient _extensions/, ajoute chris2fr/quarto\n"
"depuis le dossier courant.\n"
"\n"
"Options :\n"
"  -h, --help  Affiche cette aide et quitte."

